{"id":"invest-asset-sheet","title":"Invest \u2014 asset sheet","summary":"Proposal, not approved: a compact asset sheet from asset rows, with a proposal-only 24h sparkline and no range picker. The sparkline lives in the exploration; production chart modules are untouched. Two decisions: where the full-page link sits (A/B) and which rows open the sheet (R1/R2).","refs":{"issue":2119},"sections":[{"id":"full-page-entry","title":"Decision 1 \u2014 Full-page entry","frames":[{"id":"entry-a-mobile","story":"invest-asset-sheet--owned-mobile","label":"A \u2014 View details button","viewport":"mobile","change":"new","note":"A keeps an explicit outlined row; B saves ~60px and keeps Buy/Sell next to the balance. Stocks without trading show only View details as an action."},{"id":"entry-b-mobile","story":"invest-asset-sheet--header-link-mobile","label":"B \u2014 Title links to page","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"entry-a-desktop","story":"invest-asset-sheet--owned-desktop","label":"A \u2014 View details button","viewport":"desktop","change":"new"},{"id":"entry-b-desktop","story":"invest-asset-sheet--header-link-desktop","label":"B \u2014 Title links to page","viewport":"desktop","change":"new"},{"id":"entry-a-long-name","story":"invest-asset-sheet--long-name","label":"A \u2014 Long name","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"entry-b-long-name","story":"invest-asset-sheet--long-name-header-link","label":"B \u2014 Long name","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"}]},{"id":"rows","title":"Decision 2 \u2014 Which rows open it","frames":[{"id":"rows-open-sheet","story":"invest-asset-sheet--rows-open-sheet","label":"R1 \u2014 every asset row opens the sheet","viewport":"mobile","change":"new","note":"Discover, category lists and search (DiscoverAssetRow) plus Home and Investments holdings (BalanceRow) open the sheet; the full page is reached through the sheet or a direct link."},{"id":"holdings-open-page","story":"invest-asset-sheet--holdings-open-page","label":"R2 \u2014 holdings open the full page","viewport":"mobile","change":"new","note":"DiscoverAssetRow surfaces open the sheet; holding rows keep opening the full page."}]},{"id":"owned","title":"Owned","frames":[{"id":"owned-mobile","story":"invest-asset-sheet--owned-mobile","label":"Owned \u2014 sheet","viewport":"mobile","change":"new","note":"The proposal-only 24h sparkline lives under explorations (scrub still works, no range picker); production chart modules are untouched. Stays on the full page: the 1D\u20131Y picker, Stats (market cap, 24h volume, liquidity), About and contract details."},{"id":"page-owned-mobile","story":"invest-asset-sheet--page-owned-mobile","label":"Owned \u2014 full page","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"owned-desktop","story":"invest-asset-sheet--owned-desktop","label":"Owned \u2014 sheet","viewport":"desktop","change":"new"},{"id":"page-owned-desktop","story":"invest-asset-sheet--page-owned-desktop","label":"Owned \u2014 full page","viewport":"desktop","change":"new"}]},{"id":"unowned","title":"Unowned","frames":[{"id":"unowned-mobile","story":"invest-asset-sheet--unowned-mobile","label":"Unowned \u2014 sheet","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"page-unowned-mobile","story":"invest-asset-sheet--page-unowned-mobile","label":"Unowned \u2014 full page","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"unowned-desktop","story":"invest-asset-sheet--unowned-desktop","label":"Unowned \u2014 sheet","viewport":"desktop","change":"new"},{"id":"page-unowned-desktop","story":"invest-asset-sheet--page-unowned-desktop","label":"Unowned \u2014 full page","viewport":"desktop","change":"new"}]},{"id":"stale","title":"Stale price","frames":[{"id":"stale-mobile","story":"invest-asset-sheet--stale-mobile","label":"Stale \u2014 sheet","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"page-stale-mobile","story":"invest-asset-sheet--page-stale-mobile","label":"Stale \u2014 full page","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"stale-desktop","story":"invest-asset-sheet--stale-desktop","label":"Stale \u2014 sheet","viewport":"desktop","change":"new"},{"id":"page-stale-desktop","story":"invest-asset-sheet--page-stale-desktop","label":"Stale \u2014 full page","viewport":"desktop","change":"new"}]},{"id":"states","title":"States","frames":[{"id":"loading","story":"invest-asset-sheet--loading","label":"Loading","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"balance-unavailable","story":"invest-asset-sheet--balance-unavailable","label":"Balance unavailable","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"signed-out","story":"invest-asset-sheet--signed-out","label":"Signed out","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"empty-history","story":"invest-asset-sheet--empty-history","label":"Empty history","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"history-failed","story":"invest-asset-sheet--history-failed","label":"History failed","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"stock-last-close","story":"invest-asset-sheet--stock-last-close","label":"Stock last close","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"}]},{"id":"stress","title":"Stress","frames":[{"id":"narrow","story":"invest-asset-sheet--narrow-320","label":"320px","viewport":"narrow","change":"new"},{"id":"large-text","story":"invest-asset-sheet--large-text","label":"200% text","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"rtl","story":"invest-asset-sheet--rtl","label":"RTL","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"dark","story":"invest-asset-sheet--dark","label":"Dark","viewport":"mobile","change":"new"},{"id":"reduced-motion","story":"invest-asset-sheet--reduced-motion","label":"Reduced motion (JS preference)","viewport":"mobile","change":"new","note":"Overrides the JS motion preference only; CSS reduced motion is checked with browser emulation in the PR evidence."}]}]}